OL,3,ASexual assault case dismissed against
OL,4,ATrailer Park Boys actor Mike Smith
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge in Nova Scotia, Canada, has
OL,7,Fdismissed the sexual assault case
OL,8,Fagainst Trailer Park Boys actor Mike
OL,9,FSmith.
OL,11,FThe trial was set to begin in
OL,12,Fprovincial court in Dartmouth on
OL,13,FThursday, but after the Crown provided
OL,14,Fno evidence against Smith, the actor's
OL,15,Fattorneys requested the case be
OL,16,Fdismissed.
OL,18,FThe 54-year-old actor, who plays the
OL,19,Fcharacter Bubbles on the Canadian
OL,20,Fsitcom, was charged last year for an
OL,21,Falleged sexual assault in 2017.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
