OL,3,ASexual assault case dismissed against
OL,4,ATrailer Park Boys actor Mike Smith
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutor Bryson McDonald told
OL,7,Freporters outside court that the Crown
OL,8,Foffered no evidence in relation to the
OL,9,Fcharge "based on the Crown's ongoing
OL,10,Fassessment that the prosecution
OL,11,Fstandard has no longer been met".
